# 🧮 Calculator

A simple calculator project built using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

## ✨ Features

- ➕ Addition
- ➖ Subtraction
- ✖️ Multiplication
- ➗ Division
- 🔢 Number input
- 🧹 Clear button
- 📱 Simple and user-friendly interface

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## 🎯 Objective

The objective of this project is to practice JavaScript fundamentals and build a simple interactive web application.

## 📚 What I Learned

- JavaScript functions
- Variables and operators
- DOM manipulation
- Button click events
- Basic HTML and CSS
- Building an interactive webpage

## 🚀 Future Improvements

- Add scientific calculator functions
- Improve the user interface
- Add keyboard support
- Add calculation history
- Make the design more responsive

## 👩‍💻 About

This project was created as part of my learning journey in web development and JavaScript.

I am a T.Y. B.Sc. Computer Science student working on improving my programming and problem-solving skills.

